  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989792000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989801600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989806200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989808200000
    },
    {
      "text": "It's VF-886-2154.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989812933333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... I see an order for a VeloFit Summit Pro helmet. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989814266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989820999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. And may I ask the reason for the return? Is there an issue with the fit, or maybe the color wasn't what you expected?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989821699999
    },
    {
      "text": "The color. It's just not right.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989830099998
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. We want you to be happy with your gear. While every helmet we sell meets the highest safety standards, the look is just as important. I just need to confirm a few details.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989832366664
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989845633330
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking at the delivery date, it was 75 days ago. As long as the box is unopened and the helmet is in its original condition, that's well within our 90-day return policy. I can approve this return for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989846333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Finally. So what now?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989860866663
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just initiated the return in our system. You'll receive an email with a prepaid shipping label in the next few minutes. Just print that out, attach it to the shipping box, and you can drop it off at any authorized shipping center. Once we receive it, we'll process your full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989862933329
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Thanks, I guess.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989882266662
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with for your VeloFit products today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989884199995
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19068,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767989890933328
    },
    {
